  "notes": "机构邮箱规则更清楚\n\n- 活动仅支持学校、公司或组织的自有域邮箱；QQ、Gmail 等公共邮箱、临时邮箱和匿名转发域名不支持，登录邮箱不受影响。\n- 使用 Google、腾讯等服务托管的机构自有域邮箱仍按机构域判断。\n- 参与说明展示当前活动规则，规则变化后需要重新确认；邮箱不符合、验证码失效和资格变化都有清晰提示。\n- 不符合新要求的旧资格会显示原因，按页面提供的操作继续处理；账号切换后旧请求不会影响新页面。\n",
  "notesEn": "Clearer organization email rules\n\n- Activities require a domain owned by your school, company or organization. Public email services such as QQ and Gmail, temporary email and anonymous forwarding domains are not supported. Your sign-in email is unaffected.\n- Organization-owned domains hosted by Google, Tencent or other email providers are still assessed as organization domains.\n- Participation details show the current activity rules and require fresh confirmation when those rules change. Email eligibility, invalid codes and qualification changes now have clear messages.\n- Existing email eligibility that no longer qualifies shows the reason and available next steps. Late requests cannot affect a different account session.\n",
